  "summary": "Traefik mTLS Bypass via TLS Option Conflict",
  "details": "### Affected version metadata inconsistency\n\nThe published CVE-2026-85597 metadata contains an inconsistency in the affected version range.\n\nThe affected versions section lists Traefik v3.0.0 through v3.7.10 as affected, while the CPE applicability lists versions through v3.7.12.\n\nIt is therefore unclear from the current CVE metadata whether v3.7.11 and v3.7.12 should be considered affected. This discrepancy should be reviewed and the affected version metadata corrected accordingly.",
